<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Trusted Info rated a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Trusted Info rated a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette initiated coverage of Trusted Information Systems Inc with a buy recommendation, according to a DLJ source.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 5/8 to 12-1/4 in morning Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
